    "interconnection": "The mould stands in the outgoing shot line and the returning watch-light line. One distant coil opens the exit beside the starting station and releases the lower carrier. The carrier delivers the knight to the anvil beyond the thorn field; that anvil reaches the high return gallery, which drops onto the windward casting face. The final gust returns to the original parry platform and home door.",
    "superroom": {
      "screenAreas": 3.756521739130435,
      "stages": [
        "Send a bolt upwind through the empty screen",
        "Ride under the shared firing lane to the far anvil",
        "Return above the thorns into the casting pocket",
        "Cast the screen and ride the gale home"
      ],
      "scaleNote": "One continuous 96×36 room. The route travels from the centre to the far right, rises to the high gallery, descends to the shared frame, and returns across the original station to the far-left exit."
    },
